     see he has switched between the Hide and Fire shield increasing
     his Armor.  Whats more, he's called the spell 'armor' increasing
     his Armor + 2.  This room that they've entered has several monsters
     waiting to attack.  The monsters move in real time and not in a
     'turn' fashion such as in nethack.  Some monsters can be very
     aggressive and will chase you down and kill you.


